{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\r\n# 📝 Lista de Exercícios - PySpark com o DataFrame AI Generated Ghibli Style Image Trends (2025)\r\n\r\nhttps://www.kaggle.com/datasets/uom190346a/ai-generated-ghibli-style-image-trends-2025\r\n\r\nNeste exercício, você vai praticar operações básicas e intermediárias no PySpark usando um DataFrame que une dados de usuários e imagens geradas por IA.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n#### 📁 1. Leitura de Arquivo\r\n🔹 Leia o arquivo JSON que contém os dados combinados de no minio.\r\n\r\n```python\r\ndf = spark.read.json(\"...\")\r\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T20:39:14+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>📝 Lista de Exercícios - PySpark com o DataFrame AI Generated Ghibli Style Image Trends (2025)</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/uom190346a/ai-generated-ghibli-style-image-trends-2025\">https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/uom190346a/ai-generated-ghibli-style-image-trends-2025</a></p>\n<p>Neste exercício, você vai praticar operações básicas e intermediárias no PySpark usando um DataFrame que une dados de usuários e imagens geradas por IA.</p>\n<hr />\n<h4>📁 1. Leitura de Arquivo</h4>\n<p>🔹 Leia o arquivo JSON que contém os dados combinados de no minio.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">df = spark.read.json(&quot;...&quot;)\n</code></pre>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746736678002_662129647","id":"paragraph_1744733185639_882926082","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T20:39:17+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T20:39:14+0000"},{"text":"%pyspark\ndf_images = spark.read.json(\"s3a://bucket-teste/Ghibli_Trends/images.json\")\ndf_images.printSchema()\n\ndf_users = spark.read.json(\"s3a://bucket-teste/Ghibli_Trends/users.json\")\ndf_users.printSchema()\n\ndf = df_images.join(df_users, on = 'user_id')\ndf.printSchema()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T20:44:01+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=6"},{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=7"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746736678003_461258474","id":"paragraph_1744733642285_1295775942","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T20:44:01+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T20:44:01+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"root\n |-- comments: long (nullable = true)\n |-- creation_date: string (nullable = true)\n |-- file_size_kb: long (nullable = true)\n |-- generation_time: double (nullable = true)\n |-- gpu_usage: long (nullable = true)\n |-- image_id: string (nullable = true)\n |-- likes: long (nullable = true)\n |-- prompt: string (nullable = true)\n |-- resolution: string (nullable = true)\n |-- shares: long (nullable = true)\n |-- style_accuracy_score: long (nullable = true)\n |-- top_comment: string (nullable = true)\n |-- user_id: string (nullable = true)\n\nroot\n |-- ethical_concerns_flag: string (nullable = true)\n |-- is_hand_edited: string (nullable = true)\n |-- platform: string (nullable = true)\n |-- user_id: string (nullable = true)\n\nroot\n |-- user_id: string (nullable = true)\n |-- comments: long (nullable = true)\n |-- creation_date: string (nullable = true)\n |-- file_size_kb: long (nullable = true)\n |-- generation_time: double (nullable = true)\n |-- gpu_usage: long (nullable = true)\n |-- image_id: string (nullable = true)\n |-- likes: long (nullable = true)\n |-- prompt: string (nullable = true)\n |-- resolution: string (nullable = true)\n |-- shares: long (nullable = true)\n |-- style_accuracy_score: long (nullable = true)\n |-- top_comment: string (nullable = true)\n |-- ethical_concerns_flag: string (nullable = true)\n |-- is_hand_edited: string (nullable = true)\n |-- platform: string (nullable = true)\n\n"}]}},{"text":"%md\n#### 🔍 2. Seleção de Colunas\n🔹 Selecione apenas as colunas:\n\n`user_id`\n`platform`\n`likes`\n`prompt`\n\n🔹 E exiba as 10 primeiras linhas.\n","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>🔍 2. Seleção de Colunas</h4>\n<p>🔹 Selecione apenas as colunas:</p>\n<p><code>user_id</code><br />\n<code>platform</code><br />\n<code>likes</code><br />\n<code>prompt</code></p>\n<p>🔹 E exiba as 10 primeiras linhas.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746736678004_332958506","id":"paragraph_1744733236034_1147653727","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%pyspark\ndf.select(\n    \"user_id\",\n    \"platform\",\n    \"likes\",\n    \"prompt\"\n).show(10)","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:12:16+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=9"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746736678005_1485612260","id":"paragraph_1744733651446_944716422","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:12:17+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:12:16+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"+--------+---------+-----+--------------------+\n| user_id| platform|likes|              prompt|\n+--------+---------+-----+--------------------+\n|6a7adf3d|   Reddit|  916|Studio Ghibli-ins...|\n|523b8706|   Reddit| 2965|Ghibli-style vill...|\n|0e02592a|Instagram| 4727|A lone traveler e...|\n|9ed78a42|   TikTok| 1629|Spirited Away-sty...|\n|69ec8f02|   TikTok| 2573|Magical Ghibli fo...|\n|175d9509|  Twitter| 3715|Ghibli-style vill...|\n|049dffa8|  Twitter| 2334|A lone traveler e...|\n|ed2479d3|  Twitter| 1947|Ghibli-style nigh...|\n|4c1f78fc|  Twitter| 1851|Spirited Away-sty...|\n|d0af0554|   Reddit| 4192|Magical Ghibli fo...|\n+--------+---------+-----+--------------------+\nonly showing top 10 rows\n\n"}]}},{"text":"%md\n#### 🔄 3. Conversão de Colunas\n🔹 Converta a coluna likes para o tipo DoubleType.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>🔄 3. Conversão de Colunas</h4>\n<p>🔹 Converta a coluna likes para o tipo DoubleType.</p>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746736678005_1556844388","id":"paragraph_1744733293858_1722473296","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%pyspark\nfrom pyspark.sql.types import DoubleType\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import col\n\ndf = df.withColumn(\"likes\", col(\"likes\").cast(DoubleType()))\ndf.printSchema()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:13:54+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746736678006_2127652724","id":"paragraph_1744733823939_896300782","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:13:54+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:13:54+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"root\n |-- user_id: string (nullable = true)\n |-- comments: long (nullable = true)\n |-- creation_date: string (nullable = true)\n |-- file_size_kb: long (nullable = true)\n |-- generation_time: double (nullable = true)\n |-- gpu_usage: long (nullable = true)\n |-- image_id: string (nullable = true)\n |-- likes: double (nullable = true)\n |-- prompt: string (nullable = true)\n |-- resolution: string (nullable = true)\n |-- shares: long (nullable = true)\n |-- style_accuracy_score: long (nullable = true)\n |-- top_comment: string (nullable = true)\n |-- ethical_concerns_flag: string (nullable = true)\n |-- is_hand_edited: string (nullable = true)\n |-- platform: string (nullable = true)\n\n"}]}},{"text":"%md\n#### 🎯 4. Filtro de Dados\n🔹 Filtre o DataFrame para mostrar apenas:\n\n- Imagens com mais de 1000 curtidas\n- E que foram publicadas na plataforma TikTok","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"markdown","editOnDblClick":true,"completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h4>🎯 4. Filtro de Dados</h4>\n<p>🔹 Filtre o DataFrame para mostrar apenas:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Imagens com mais de 1000 curtidas</li>\n<li>E que foram publicadas na plataforma TikTok</li>\n</ul>\n\n</div>"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746736678006_1362178042","id":"paragraph_1744733631508_1641498737","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","status":"READY"},{"text":"%pyspark\nfrom pyspark.sql.functions import col\n\nfiltered_df = df.filter(\n    (col(\"likes\") > 1000) &        # Mais de 1000 curtidas\n    (col(\"platform\") == \"TikTok\")  # Publicado no TikTok\n)\n\nfiltered_df.show()","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-05-08T21:14:35+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"language":"python","editOnDblClick":false,"completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{"jobUrl":{"propertyName":"jobUrl","label":"SPARK JOB","tooltip":"View in Spark web UI","group":"spark","values":[{"jobUrl":"http://e8aa2bb97306:4040/jobs/job?id=13"}],"interpreterSettingId":"spark"}},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1746736678007_1396138278","id":"paragraph_1744733829247_334804799","dateCreated":"2025-05-08T20:37:58+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-05-08T21:14:32+0000","dateStarted":"2025-05-08T21:14:32+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"TEXT","data":"+--------+--------+-------------+------------+---------------+---------+--------------------+------+--------------------+----------+------+--------------------+--------------------+---------------------+--------------+--------+\n| user_